1
00:00:25,183 --> 00:00:28,016
♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

2
00:00:28,436 --> 00:00:31,043
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

3
00:00:31,356 --> 00:00:33,936
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

4
00:00:34,656 --> 00:00:37,529
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

5
00:00:38,129 --> 00:00:40,083
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

6
00:00:40,256 --> 00:00:43,056
♪Calm but full of pearls♪

7
00:00:44,050 --> 00:00:45,963
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

8
00:00:46,383 --> 00:00:49,209
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:00:53,399 --> 00:00:55,079
I can't leave my wife.

10
00:00:55,439 --> 00:00:56,960
I'm staying here tonight.

11
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:58,240
Without her beside me,

12
00:00:58,960 --> 00:01:00,079
I can't sleep.

13
00:01:02,399 --> 00:01:03,399
Well, look.

14
00:01:04,640 --> 00:01:06,560
I didn't think this through.

15
00:01:06,680 --> 00:01:08,159
You're newlyweds, after all.

16
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:10,359
How could I separate you two?

17
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:12,280
It's so nice of you
to be this understanding.

18
00:01:13,079 --> 00:01:14,120
We're so lucky.

19
00:01:14,319 --> 00:01:16,159
Then we'll leave it to you.

20
00:01:28,760 --> 00:01:29,799
Tonight's banquet

21
00:01:30,040 --> 00:01:31,560
is mainly to welcome Grandma home.

22
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:32,840
Also,

23
00:01:33,359 --> 00:01:34,480
to welcome

24
00:01:34,480 --> 00:01:36,120
our powerful new son-in-law.

25
00:01:36,439 --> 00:01:37,000
Here.

26
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:48,239
We're honored to have you

27
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:50,200
host us personally, Uncle.

28
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:52,400
But since this is a family dinner,

29
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:54,319
we shouldn't leave out our elders.

30
00:01:58,079 --> 00:01:59,319
Which elders do you mean?

31
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,560
Shouldn't we

32
00:02:02,159 --> 00:02:04,840
set extra place settings

33
00:02:05,159 --> 00:02:06,359
for my parents-in-law?

34
00:02:12,479 --> 00:02:14,039
They've been gone for ages.

35
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:15,599
No need for such a ceremony.

36
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:17,919
You're right.

37
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:19,479
It's just a formality.

38
00:02:21,199 --> 00:02:22,280
But today,

39
00:02:24,319 --> 00:02:26,560
it's my first time sitting here

40
00:02:26,879 --> 00:02:28,319
as Mingyu's husband.

41
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:31,479
I'd like to honor that tradition

42
00:02:31,919 --> 00:02:33,680
as a small gesture of respect.

43
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:40,439
Surely you won't deny me

44
00:02:40,719 --> 00:02:41,879
even this small courtesy?

45
00:02:48,039 --> 00:02:48,879
Do it.

46
00:02:55,549 --> 00:02:56,011
=Quite The Girl=

47
00:02:56,023 --> 00:02:56,624
(Adapted from the Tomato novel
"Quite The Girl.")

48
00:02:56,636 --> 00:02:57,178
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

49
00:02:57,190 --> 00:02:58,496
=Episode 21=

50
00:03:21,599 --> 00:03:23,360
Qiuliang, let's switch seats.

51
00:03:23,439 --> 00:03:24,599
Your seat's closer to Mom

52
00:03:24,599 --> 00:03:26,039
so I can serve her more easily.

53
00:03:26,039 --> 00:03:26,879
Come on, Qiuliang.

54
00:03:39,919 --> 00:03:40,520
Are you okay?

55
00:03:41,599 --> 00:03:42,360
I'm fine.

56
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:44,039
Sorry, everyone.

57
00:03:44,759 --> 00:03:46,159
I'll go change my clothes.

58
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:53,240
Butler, replace the cup.

59
00:03:57,479 --> 00:03:58,360
Have some more.

60
00:04:12,919 --> 00:04:13,759
Weiwei?

61
00:04:14,039 --> 00:04:15,520
Weiwei, are you back?

62
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:52,600
Auntie,

63
00:04:52,839 --> 00:04:54,560
when I went to change,

64
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:55,879
I found the outfit

65
00:04:55,879 --> 00:04:57,399
my mother used to love wearing.

66
00:04:57,424 --> 00:04:59,199
I missed her so much

67
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,399
that I put it on.

68
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:03,040
You and my mother were so close,

69
00:05:03,199 --> 00:05:04,519
like sisters.

70
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:06,079
Do you miss her

71
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:07,680
as much as I do?

72
00:05:13,759 --> 00:05:14,319
Yes...

73
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:15,879
I miss my sister-in-law.

74
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:34,360
Why are you trembling so much?

75
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:35,879
Did you catch a chill?

76
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:37,160
Here.

77
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,839
Have some chicken soup to warm up.

78
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:45,680
You're so thoughtful.

79
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:46,439
I'm fine.

80
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:48,240
Really, I'm fine.

81
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:17,040
We've been broken up for ages.

82
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:19,800
Why keep the ring you gave me?

83
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:34,680
Who said it was for you?

84
00:06:35,596 --> 00:06:39,436
♪The day we met♪

85
00:06:40,040 --> 00:06:41,319
Do I need to remind you

86
00:06:41,839 --> 00:06:43,399
what initials are engraved inside?

87
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:46,399
D-X-M.

88
00:06:46,959 --> 00:06:47,879
Who else could it be for?

89
00:06:48,639 --> 00:06:49,439
Let's go home.

90
00:06:49,519 --> 00:06:50,319
Do it next time.

91
00:06:50,396 --> 00:06:51,076
Okay.

92
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,519
DXM...

93
00:06:58,279 --> 00:06:59,839
Does that have to mean Duan Xiuming?

94
00:07:00,199 --> 00:07:01,879
Couldn't it mean Da-Xiong-Mao?
[*Panda.]

95
00:07:05,223 --> 00:07:12,069
♪You took my hand, said don't be scared♪

96
00:07:12,429 --> 00:07:18,876
♪With you, no place is far♪

97
00:07:19,623 --> 00:07:26,616
♪Now I know what longing is♪

98
00:07:27,350 --> 00:07:33,963
♪From dawn to starlight with you♪

99
00:07:34,276 --> 00:07:37,289
♪You're all my joy♪

100
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:39,360
You're talking so tough,

101
00:07:40,120 --> 00:07:41,399
but your lips are pretty soft.

102
00:07:41,983 --> 00:07:47,763
♪I want to grow old with you♪

103
00:07:49,519 --> 00:07:50,439
Right size.

104
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:53,639
I was going to toss it anyway.

105
00:07:53,839 --> 00:07:55,040
Since you like it,

106
00:07:55,079 --> 00:07:56,360
you might as well have it.

107
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:06,839
Let him see.

108
00:08:16,199 --> 00:08:17,000
Honey.

109
00:08:17,759 --> 00:08:18,920
This bedroom is so cozy.

110
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:20,399
Shouldn't we do something to enjoy it?

111
00:08:22,350 --> 00:08:24,936
♪Soft look hides the fire deep inside♪

112
00:08:25,570 --> 00:08:27,916
♪Gentle smile never tells my fight♪

113
00:08:28,056 --> 00:08:31,189
♪They think I'm weak, easy to control♪

114
00:08:31,343 --> 00:08:34,343
♪I keep my calm, hide all my soul♪

115
00:08:34,490 --> 00:08:37,416
♪Bite back tears, hold every pain♪

116
00:08:37,470 --> 00:08:40,469
♪Silently plan to break the chain♪

117
00:08:40,770 --> 00:08:42,863
♪No one's shelter, no one's reliance♪

118
00:08:42,983 --> 00:08:46,896
♪I walk alone with silent defiance♪

119
00:08:47,683 --> 00:08:50,809
♪I don't wait for someone to save me♪

120
00:08:50,843 --> 00:08:54,009
♪Don't beg for mercy,
don't bow down freely♪

121
00:08:54,143 --> 00:08:57,003
♪Wisdom sharp like blade unseen♪

122
00:08:57,016 --> 00:08:59,749
♪I hold my fate within my hand clean♪

123
00:08:59,841 --> 00:09:03,229
♪I'm a good girl but not naive♪

124
00:09:03,390 --> 00:09:06,063
♪Power hidden underneath♪

125
00:09:06,183 --> 00:09:08,763
♪Fight my way, rise from the grief♪

126
00:09:09,003 --> 00:09:12,136
♪Rule my world, set myself free♪

127
00:09:12,483 --> 00:09:14,969
♪No more bondage, no more deceit♪

128
00:09:15,096 --> 00:09:18,336
♪My own salvation I believe♪

129
00:09:18,610 --> 00:09:21,029
♪Burn the haze, break every siege♪

130
00:09:36,156 --> 00:09:40,649
♪Maybe we met by chance♪

131
00:09:42,916 --> 00:09:47,203
♪One glance, and I fell♪

132
00:09:49,189 --> 00:09:51,763
♪The moment we passed by♪

133
00:09:52,403 --> 00:09:55,876
♪My heartbeat lingered in my ear♪

134
00:09:56,036 --> 00:10:00,516
♪Your face froze before my eyes♪

135
00:10:01,656 --> 00:10:03,929
♪I'm always here♪

136
00:10:11,320 --> 00:10:12,639
Weren't you so reserved

137
00:10:12,639 --> 00:10:13,919
at Mr. Zhou's place?

138
00:10:15,720 --> 00:10:17,240
What happened today?

139
00:10:19,679 --> 00:10:21,799
We're just meeting each other's needs.

140
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:23,320
I know exactly

141
00:10:23,879 --> 00:10:25,080
what our relationship is.

142
00:10:28,639 --> 00:10:29,720
That's what you tell yourself.

143
00:10:30,039 --> 00:10:31,240
Does your body agree?

144
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:36,080
Let me ask you.

145
00:10:37,679 --> 00:10:39,720
There is a plant-based hallucinogen

146
00:10:39,799 --> 00:10:41,440
in Xiangjiang, right?

147
00:10:41,679 --> 00:10:42,519
What are you planning?

148
00:10:42,840 --> 00:10:44,399
I've read my mother's medical records.

149
00:10:44,639 --> 00:10:46,519
I suspect Du Wenxin tampered with them.

150
00:10:47,440 --> 00:10:49,440
Her reaction earlier gave her away.

151
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:51,600
Getting her to take the powder

152
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:53,039
might force the truth out of her.

153
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:55,480
That stuff is risky.

154
00:10:55,559 --> 00:10:56,559
I want to try.

155
00:10:58,200 --> 00:10:59,279
I'll have Zhan Xiang get some.

156
00:11:00,159 --> 00:11:01,279
Come by tomorrow night.

157
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:02,200
Okay.

158
00:11:30,653 --> 00:11:35,246
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

159
00:11:37,833 --> 00:11:41,786
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

160
00:11:44,813 --> 00:11:49,293
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

161
00:11:50,626 --> 00:11:55,473
♪Chimes and cicadas have loved so long♪

162
00:11:57,960 --> 00:12:04,513
♪A love letter written in song♪

163
00:12:04,813 --> 00:12:09,773
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

164
00:12:12,130 --> 00:12:18,276
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

165
00:12:18,802 --> 00:12:24,768
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

166
00:12:25,331 --> 00:12:29,574
♪Gemini's joy♪

167
00:12:29,598 --> 00:12:32,327
♪Lets art fill our love♪

168
00:12:33,087 --> 00:12:35,246
♪Close your eyes and count♪

169
00:12:35,537 --> 00:12:38,163
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

170
00:12:38,163 --> 00:12:44,648
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪
